  "\"So what do you like reading, besides fantasy?\" Then actually follow up on her answer.": "“除了奇幻小说，你还喜欢看什么？”然后认真接着她的回答聊下去。",
  "Um. Old Singapore ghost stories? My grandma told them. I'm trying to write some down.": "嗯……新加坡的老鬼故事？我外婆以前讲给我听的。我在试着把它们写下来。",
  "Wait, you write? What's the scariest one?": "等等，你会写东西？最恐怖的是哪个？",
  "...The pontianak at the banana tree near her kampung. Okay, sit down. This takes a while.": "……就是她甘榜（马来乡村）香蕉树下的女鬼“庞蒂雅娜”。好，你坐好，这个要讲很久。",
  "Explain your mobile game rank in detail. All forty minutes.": "详细介绍你的手游段位。整整四十分钟。",
  "By minute twenty, chibi Xin Yi has fallen asleep standing up. By minute thirty-five, so has the uncle behind you.": "第二十分钟，Q版欣怡站着睡着了。第三十五分钟，你身后的安哥也睡着了。",
  "A conversation is a game of catch, rookie. You just threw forty balls into the sea.": "聊天就像玩传接球，菜鸟。你刚刚把四十个球全扔进了海里。",
  "(Stay on your phone.)": "（继续玩手机。）",
  "She reads. You scroll. The queue moves. Nothing happens.": "她看书，你滑手机。队伍往前挪。什么都没发生。",
