  "Kavya is next to you, looking at the sea. She ran a time trial this morning before coming.": "卡维娅坐在你旁边看海。她今天早上来之前刚跑完一次计时赛。",
  "Say something to Kavya...": "跟卡维娅说点什么……",
  "\"Your 100m split at trials was insane. How do you even start that fast?\"": "“你选拔时的一百米分段太猛了。你到底是怎么起跑那么快的？”",
  "You watched? ...It's the first three steps. Everyone thinks it's the legs. It's the arms.": "你有看？……关键是前三步。大家都以为靠腿，其实是靠手臂。",
