  "Wow. Did you get that from a guy in a rented Lamborghini?": "哇。这是哪个开租来兰博基尼的家伙教你的？",
  "She laughs. At you. Haziq, across the cabin, facepalms so hard the cable car wobbles.": "她笑了。是笑你。车厢另一头的哈齐克捂脸捂得太用力，整个缆车都晃了。",
  "(Deep voice.) \"I'm the prize here. You should be trying to impress me.\"": "（压低嗓子。）“我才是奖品。你应该努力让我心动。”",
  "At the next stop, all five people in the cabin get off. You ride to Sentosa alone, with your deep voice.": "到了下一站，车厢里五个人全下车了。你独自坐到圣淘沙，带着你的低音炮。",
  "BAD END #4 — Negged Yourself": "BAD END #4 — 打压到了自己",
  "You tried to make someone feel smaller so you would look bigger. It worked, sort of: you are now very alone in a very big cable car. Confidence is not putting someone down. It is being comfortable while lifting them up.": "你想让别人觉得自己渺小，好显得你高大。某种程度上成功了：你现在一个人坐在一个很大的缆车里。自信不是贬低别人，而是在托起别人的时候，依然自在。",
  "A dessert stall near the beach. Mango bingsu, $18 for the \"premium\" one. Your whole month's pocket money is about $100.": "海滩附近的甜品摊。芒果雪冰，“豪华版”一份$18。你整个月的零用钱大概才$100。",
  "You want to look generous...": "你想显得大方……",
