  "The arcade has a VR horror ride for pairs. Elise grabs your arm and points her phone at both of you.": "游戏中心有一个双人VR恐怖体验。伊莉丝挽住你的手臂，拿手机对着你们俩。",
  "Say something scared for my story! Pretend you're protecting me~": "说句害怕的话给我拍限时动态！假装你在保护我～",
