  "Siloso Beach. Haziq tries a \"cool\" trick on the rope swing and lands face-first in the sea. Everyone laughs.": "西乐索海滩。哈齐克想在绳索秋千上耍个“帅”，结果脸朝下栽进了海里。大家都笑了。",
  "Haziq is dripping and red-faced...": "哈齐克浑身湿透，满脸通红……",
  "Help him out, throw him your jacket, laugh WITH him: \"Ten out of ten for commitment, bro.\"": "拉他一把，把外套丢给他，跟他一起笑：“兄弟，投入程度满分。”",
  "Bro... you're a real one. I had a whole plan. The plan was bad.": "兄弟……你够义气。我本来有一整套计划的。计划很烂。",
  "\"This is why you're single, bro.\" Wait for the laugh.": "“兄弟，这就是你单身的原因。”然后等大家笑。",
  "A few people laugh. Hanis doesn't. Haziq laughs too, a beat late, and goes quiet for the rest of the day.": "有几个人笑了。哈妮丝没笑。哈齐克也跟着笑，慢了半拍，然后一整天都没怎么说话。",
  "Sunset on the sand. Elise is filming the sky. Xin Yi is writing on her phone. Somebody asks how many close friends you all have.": "沙滩上的日落。伊莉丝在拍天空。欣怡在手机上写东西。有人问大家各有几个好朋友。",
  "{n:yuna} has four hundred \"besties\". {n:mio} has one. What do you think makes a good friend?": "{n:yuna}有四百个“好闺蜜”。{n:mio}只有一个。你觉得怎样才算好朋友？",
  "\"I think it depends on the person. What does one close friend give you that a crowd can't?\"": "“我觉得因人而异。一个知心朋友能给你什么，是一大群人给不了的？”",
  "And your own view?": "那你自己的看法呢？",
  "\"A few deep friends. People who'd come at 3 AM.\"": "“几个深交的朋友就够了。凌晨三点也会赶来的那种。”",
