  "skip school Monday and come see me? just you and me ✨": "星期一翘课来见我？就我们两个✨",
  "Rae wants you to come away from your friends...": "瑞儿想让你离开你的朋友……",
  "\"I'm having fun with my friends! See you never 😅\" Put the phone away and sing.": "“我跟朋友玩得正开心！永别啦😅”把手机收起来，继续唱。",
