  "Monday. A man in a suit sits down where Rae was supposed to be. \"Your girlfriend sends her love. Now, about the account...\"": "星期一。一个穿西装的男人坐在本该是瑞儿的位置上。“你女朋友向你问好。现在，关于那个账户……”",
